    "definition": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "wide",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Daily nutritional support for skin resilience.",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "body": "<p>Dermaboost+ brings together vitamins, minerals, carotenoids, and botanical polyphenols selected for complementary roles in antioxidant defense, normal immune function, and skin-health biology.</p><p>Rather than relying on one ingredient, the formula is structured around multiple pathways.</p>",
        "quote": "Restore is not about reversing time. It is about supporting resilience.†"
      }
    },
